{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-03_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-03","title":"迴旋","storyCode":"3-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-03_end.txt","sourceHash":"ab493373a306a876db1c38d9415a295f02855436328d00edd21a12965ef85c01","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"羅德島的襲擊使得碎骨不得不做出行動，面對米莎的遲疑，碎骨毫不猶豫地做出了否定。\n而W更是在此時獻上了一條計謀。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十五关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，是扳機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"只要這樣裝上彈藥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"瞄準敵人，按下扳機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"之後，彈藥就會飛出去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，握住把柄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"聚精會神......施術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，就能引爆彈藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道我能不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定可以的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"我在你身上感到了和我相同的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"想像一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"來，握住這顆源石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"集中精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"掌心有些......熱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，果然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"米莎，你確實，確實......哈哈，哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"你確實是我的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......走！碎骨，快撤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"這個礦場不能再呆下去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"是羅德島的進攻！我們被襲擊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"—————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"這群混蛋————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"不要慌張，組織大家進行反擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"碎骨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是羅德島的話......我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"——怎麼？要我和羅德島談談？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"他們，他們一定會幫助感染者的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"我那麼多同胞都死在羅德島手上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"你卻讓我，和他們談談？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"我的同胞，他們都是感染者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"聲稱自己會救助感染者的羅德島，難道幫助過他們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"究竟是什麼東西蒙蔽了你的雙眼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"——對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"我有些衝動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，確實——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者好不容易擁有了一絲希望——整合運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"但羅德島，他們作為感染者，卻在這個時候來傷害我們，屠殺我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"他們，難道不是叛徒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算和叛徒談什麼呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者就一定要自相殘殺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"那我該怎麼辦呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"難道要我任由同胞死去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會保護你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"你也要，保護好自己......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"別被戰鬥波及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"千萬要小心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"你......一定要回來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我好不容易才......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我會回來找你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候，我們一起回家——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"喲呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"還是需要我幫你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"其實......我覺得事情，和塔露拉說的，有些不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人比我們想像的要強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你必須保護米莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有這個義務吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"你有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"行，行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"但，光是保護米莎，並不太夠吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果失敗，他們始終會追上來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什麼辦法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"碎骨，我和你說過吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"......我記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"——只要幹掉那個目標，戰局就能瞬間逆轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯哦。殺死敵方指揮官，很簡單吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"就是兔子身邊那個，帶著兜帽的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島所有的戰鬥都是這個傢伙在指揮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"只要殺掉他，喀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的大腦就壞死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼會變得簡單的~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的人不多了，可用的戰術也很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"在礦場前面有一個很好的埋伏圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我這裡的術師會幫你做些掩護——你知道該做什麼吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我的部下會把他們引過來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"好好把握這個機會~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"——幫我照顧好米莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。那麼......祝你好運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["米莎"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["碎骨"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]}]}
